          "tags": [
            "家庭",
            "代际"
          ],
          "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/kkk-bot/HowToGetAlong"
        },
        {
          "id": "get-along-8-6",
          "title": "冲突后要有修复动作",
          "core": "不冷战是底线。",
          "body": [
